    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-col4">
        <head xml:id="gom-col4-Hd1e98">Caput 4</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-col4-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-col4-Hd1e102">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-col4-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-col4-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/col4_3@10-10">Ostium.</quote>
            Id est os meum faciat apertum: quod ad hoc datum est, ut inde prodeat verbum. Apertum est, quando multa et magna dicit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-col4-Dd1e111">
          <head xml:id="gom-col4-Hd1e113">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-col4-d1e115">
            <quote xml:id="gom-col4-Qd1e117" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/col4_5@9-10">Tempus redimentes.</quote>
            Id est opportunitatem praedicandi eis, aliquibus modis, praeparantes.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-col4-Dd1e122">
          <head xml:id="gom-col4-Hd1e124">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-col4-d1e126">
            <quote xml:id="gom-col4-Qd1e128" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/col4_8@8-17">Ut cognoscat quae circa vos sunt et consoletur corda vestra,</quote>
            etc. Magis cavet qui se videt cognosci, quam qui se videt ignorari.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-col4-Dd1e133">
          <head xml:id="gom-col4-Hd1e135">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-col4-d1e137">
            <quote xml:id="gom-col4-Qd1e139" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/col4_10@12-12">Accepistis,</quote>
            quod rediit ad me, et ideo si venerit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-col4-Dd1e145">
          <head xml:id="gom-col4-Hd1e147">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-col4-d1e149">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0616B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-col4-Qd1e153" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/col4_16@8-11">Facite ut et in,</quote>
            etc. Ex hoc loco intelligimus, quod generales sunt instructiones Apostoli, et ad omnium hominum profectum scriptae sunt epistolae.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-col4-Dd1e158">
          <head xml:id="gom-col4-Hd1e160">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-col4-d1e162">
            <quote xml:id="gom-col4-Qd1e164" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/col4_18@5-6">Memores estote,</quote>
            etc. Antequam salutationem ponat, praemittit exhortationem dicens: <quote xml:id="gom-col4-Qd1e167" source="http://scta.info/resource/col4_18@5-5">Memores,</quote> etc.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
